  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3
    value: <style=title><size=42>WHEEL BONUS TRIGGER</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3
    value: "<size=24>- Mystery event is triggered, where random symbols appear \n
      \ lit for one spin.\n- 3, 4, or 5 consecutive lit symbols in a horizontal line
      triggers \n  the Wheel Bonus.\n- 3, 4, and 5 lit symbols enable the MINI, MAJOR,
      \n  and GRAND awards respectively.\n- Wheel may consist of Jackpot, Free Games,
      Random Wilds, \n  Upgrade, and Coin awards."
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4
    value: "<size=24><b>UPGRADE</b>\n- Awards one spin in another Wheel with upgrade
      awards.\n\n<b>Coin Award</b>\n- Awards coin amount multiplied by Total Bet.\n\n<b>Random
      Wild</b>\n- Awards 1 Free Game with awarded number of Wilds.\n\n<b>Free Games</b>\n-
      Awards the number of Free Games with more Wild symbols\n  than in Base Game."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
